{"id":"3c043773cb49e8df","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-pushout.md","title":"Pushout","display":"df-pushout — Pushout","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-pushout","aliases":["58-df-pushout","Pushout"],"display":"df-pushout — Pushout","depends_on":["[[58-df-categorical-pushout]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-pushout"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-pushout</span><span>Pushout</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pushout — Pushout"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7cd0504ab191f721\" href=\"?note=7cd0504ab191f721\" title=\"58-df-categorical-pushout\">58-df-categorical-pushout</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> (ambient category)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A \\xrightarrow{f} B, A \\xrightarrow{g} C\">\\(A \\xrightarrow{f} B, A \\xrightarrow{g} C\\)</span> (arrows)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> (object receiving maps from <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B, C\">\\(B, C\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi_B: B \\to D, \\phi_C: C \\to D\">\\(\\phi_B: B \\to D, \\phi_C: C \\to D\\)</span> (cone maps)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Pushout}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{Pushout}_S\\)</span> (pushout predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Pushout}_{\\mathcal C}\">\\(\\mathrm{Pushout}_{\\mathcal C}\\)</span> (canonical pushout predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7cd0504ab191f721\" href=\"?note=7cd0504ab191f721\" title=\"58-df-categorical-pushout\">58-df-categorical-pushout</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pushout} \\vdash \\operatorname{Pushout}_S(D,\\phi_B,\\phi_C,f,g,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Pushout}_{\\mathcal C}(D,\\phi_B,\\phi_C,f,g)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pushout} \\vdash \\operatorname{Pushout}_S(D,\\phi_B,\\phi_C,f,g,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Pushout}_{\\mathcal C}(D,\\phi_B,\\phi_C,f,g)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This atom is a short-name wrapper around the fully typed categorical pushout predicate.</li>\n<li>Amalgam: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B \\cup_A C\">\\(B \\cup_A C\\)</span> glues spaces along common subspace <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>; fundamental group of graphs</li>\n<li>Van Kampen: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_1(U \\cup_0 V) = \\pi_1(U) *_{\\pi_1(O)} \\pi_1(V)\">\\(\\pi_1(U \\cup_0 V) = \\pi_1(U) *_{\\pi_1(O)} \\pi_1(V)\\)</span>; pushout for fundamental groupoids</li>\n<li>Fiber product: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B \\times_C D\">\\(B \\times_C D\\)</span> is pullback; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B \\cup_A D\">\\(B \\cup_A D\\)</span> is pushout in spaces</li>\n<li>Amalgamation is a downstream special case of pushouts.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Mac Lane, Categories for the Working Mathematician</li>\n<li>May, A Concise Course in Algebraic Topology</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-categorical-pushout","status":"resolved","id":"7cd0504ab191f721","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-categorical-pushout]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-categorical-pushout","status":"resolved","id":"7cd0504ab191f721","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Pushout}_{\\mathcal C}$ (canonical pushout predicate, see [[58-df-categorical-pushout]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"A \\xrightarrow{f} B, A \\xrightarrow{g} C","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"B, C","display":false},{"tex":"\\phi_B: B \\to D, \\phi_C: C \\to D","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Pushout}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Pushout}_{\\mathcal C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pushout} \\vdash \\operatorname{Pushout}_S(D,\\phi_B,\\phi_C,f,g,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Pushout}_{\\mathcal C}(D,\\phi_B,\\phi_C,f,g)","display":true},{"tex":"B \\cup_A C","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_1(U \\cup_0 V) = \\pi_1(U) *_{\\pi_1(O)} \\pi_1(V)","display":false},{"tex":"B \\times_C D","display":false},{"tex":"B \\cup_A D","display":false}],"bytes":1317,"backlinks":[{"id":"330e2dbf7702faae","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7518a72e7d60ad45","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{PathConnected}_S$ is the predicate from [[58-df-path-connected]] and $\\operatorname{Pushout}_S$ is the categorical pushout predicate from [[58-df-pushout]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1019","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-pushout.md|58-df-pushout]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["7cd0504ab191f721"]}